[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
DesignCraft opens and saves files through the XDG desktop portal, which
needs a D-Bus session bus.  If your desktop does not start one, run
DesignCraft under one, for example with

  dbus-run-session designcraft

DesignCraft renders with Vulkan when a Vulkan driver is installed and
falls back to OpenGL ES (EGL) otherwise.

Printing goes through CUPS (lpstat): install print/cups to print.
EOM
}
]
